      "transcript": "My crafty friend, I want us to go even deeper into our ideas. And with Gist, we can. Gist is building an app that encourages insightful posting, where we can teach each other what we know, show each other what we're working on, and celebrate each other's creativity with thoughtful engagement. That's why I think this is a great opportunity for crafters and DIYers to shine, because we already have some of the richest knowledge to share with each other. And since it's an immersive platform where videos, photos, discussions, and articles all live together on the same feeds, you can create the style of post that works best for you to express yourself. If that sounds like something that you want to be a part of, then download the app, spend a few minutes refining your interest, and then start sharing what really lights you up. I'll see you there.",
